jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-037","source_id":"s-jinshu037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p018","quote":"會惠帝西遷，虓與從兄平昌公模、長史馮嵩等刑白馬喢血而盟，推東海王越為盟主，虓都督河北諸軍事、驃騎將軍、持節，領豫州刺史。劉喬不受越等節度，乘虛破許。虓自拔渡河，王浚表虓領翼州刺史，資以兵馬。虓入翼州發兵，又南濟河，破喬等。河間王顒聞喬敗，斬張方，傳首於越。越與虓西迎帝，而顒出奔。於是奉天子還都，拜虓為司徒。永興三年暴疾薨，時年三十七。無子，養模子黎為嗣，黎隨模就國，于長安遇害。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p018:m0174","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p018:m0010"}],"interpretation_note":"本完整收到單元原詞與雙人物錨；不由列表補絕對排行或同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-jin037-near-020","subject_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADBDB","predicate":"adoptive_father","object_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADCA","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"無子，養模子黎為嗣","source_clause_binding":{"kind":"biography_family_clause","rule":"fixed_jin037_near_family","contract_ref":"source-evidence/jin037-gaomi-nanyang/source-contract.json"},"adoption_basis":"explicit_named_biological_father_child_as_heir","modern_legal_status":"not_inferred","biological_father_assertion_id":"a-jin037-near-019"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-037","source_id":"s-jinshu037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p018","quote":"會惠帝西遷，虓與從兄平昌公模、長史馮嵩等刑白馬喢血而盟，推東海王越為盟主，虓都督河北諸軍事、驃騎將軍、持節，領豫州刺史。劉喬不受越等節度，乘虛破許。虓自拔渡河，王浚表虓領翼州刺史，資以兵馬。虓入翼州發兵，又南濟河，破喬等。河間王顒聞喬敗，斬張方，傳首於越。越與虓西迎帝，而顒出奔。於是奉天子還都，拜虓為司徒。永興三年暴疾薨，時年三十七。無子，養模子黎為嗣，黎隨模就國，于長安遇害。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p018:m0174","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p018:m0006"}],"interpretation_note":"明言養模子黎，生父模與養父虓分存；ID位置採生父，不把養父替換生父。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_